  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. Dividing each side of the given equation by <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"x minus 9 equals 8\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>8</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.&nbsp;Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"x minus 9\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>9</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"3 x minus 27\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>27</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"x minus 9\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>9</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>",
